# This example shows how to use a custom script to configure DNS entries for
# the DNS-01 challenge.

accept_tos
email hostmaster@example.com

# The custom script is called in the following order:
#
#   /opt/acme/cf-dns-util.py present
#       Configure the DNS record
#   /opt/acme/cf-dns-util.py wait
#       Optional: wait for DNS propagation (or just immediately return)
#   /opt/acme/cf-dns-util.py cleanup
#       Remove the DNS record
#
# See examples/cf-dns-util.py for its example implementation
dns exec /opt/acme/cf-dns-util.py
domain www.example.com
